Bet 50 goes in, and the dealer calls. Before the showdown I need to correct my last turn: I described the discard and draw but never updated your cards on the table. Your hand is now Q♠ 9♥ 9♦ 6♣ 10♦. The dealer's K♥ 7♣ 3♦ J♠ 8♥ is king high. Your pair of nines wins the 100-chip pot, so you're up 50 at 1,050.

